---
import PricingToggle from '../react/PricingToggle.tsx';
---

<section class="border-ink/[0.09] overflow-hidden sm:px-8 lg:px-10 border-t pt-24 pr-5 pb-24 pl-5 relative" id="pricing">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-[34rem] w-[34rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-ink/10 blur-3xl"></div>
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.035]" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(10,37,64,0.85) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,37,64,0.65) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 28rem 28rem;"></div>
<div class="z-10 w-full max-w-[1280px] mr-auto ml-auto relative">
<div class="reveal grid w-full max-w-[1280px] gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] lg:items-end">
<div class="max-w-3xl">
<p class="text-[13px] font-medium text-ink-soft">06 · Preços</p>
<h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[56px] font-display font-medium">Planos simples para times que querem clareza.</h2>
</div>
<div class="lg:ml-auto lg:max-w-md">
<p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Comece grátis e faça upgrade quando seu time precisar de mais projetos, relatórios e controles de colaboração.</p>
<PricingToggle client:idle />
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">

<article class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-paper/[0.70] to-transparent p-8 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border border-ink/[0.12] transition-colors group-hover:border-ink/[0.22]"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ink-2/40 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
<div>
<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft">Starter</p>
<h3 class="mt-3 text-[24px] tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium">Para se organizar</h3>
</div>
<span class="rounded-full border border-ink/[0.12] bg-paper/[0.65] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">Grátis</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-8">
<div class="flex items-end gap-2">
<span class="text-5xl tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium" data-plan="starter" data-price-monthly="R$0" data-price-annual="R$0">R$0</span>
<span class="pb-2 text-sm text-ink-soft" data-plan="starter" data-period-monthly="/ mês" data-period-annual="/ mês">/ mês</span>
</div>
<p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Um workspace tranquilo para indivíduos e times pequenos começando seus primeiros projetos.</p>
</div>
<a class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/[0.12] bg-paper/[0.65] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition duration-300 ease-out hover:border-ink/[0.22] hover:bg-paper/[0.88]" href="#cta">Começar grátis</a>
<div class="mt-8 h-px w-full bg-paper/[0.82]"></div>
<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-ink-soft">
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Até 3 projetos</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Quadros de tarefas simples</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Datas de entrega e responsáveis</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Resumo de atividade semanal</li>
</ul>
</article>

<article class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-accent/[0.13] via-paper/[0.55] to-transparent p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-ink/[0.09] transition duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border border-accent/40 transition-colors group-hover:border-accent/60"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-accent/60 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
<div>
<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-2">Pro</p>
<h3 class="mt-3 text-[24px] tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium">Para times focados</h3>
</div>
<span class="rounded-full border border-ink-2/20 bg-ink-soft/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink">Popular</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-8">
<div class="flex items-end gap-2">
<span class="text-5xl tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium" data-plan="pro" data-price-monthly="R$12" data-price-annual="R$10">R$12</span>
<span class="pb-2 text-sm text-ink-soft" data-plan="pro" data-period-monthly="/ usuário / mês" data-period-annual="/ usuário / mês, no anual">/ usuário / mês</span>
</div>
<p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Tudo o que times pequenos precisam para planejar o trabalho, manter o alinhamento e entregar com consistência.</p>
</div>
<a class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-ink px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-paper shadow-2xl shadow-ink/20 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-accent-ink-strong" href="#cta">Iniciar teste de 14 dias</a>
<div class="mt-8 h-px w-full bg-ink/15"></div>
<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-2/15 text-ink"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Projetos ilimitados</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-2/15 text-ink"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Visualizações de linha do tempo e calendário</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-2/15 text-ink"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Etiquetas de prioridade e filtros</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-2/15 text-ink"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Comentários e menções da equipe</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-2/15 text-ink"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Relatórios de progresso</li>
</ul>
</article>

<article class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-paper/[0.70] to-transparent p-8 transition duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border border-ink/[0.12] transition-colors group-hover:border-ink/[0.22]"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ink-2/40 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
<div>
<p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-soft">Business</p>
<h3 class="mt-3 text-[24px] tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium">Para times em crescimento</h3>
</div>
<span class="rounded-full border border-ink/[0.12] bg-paper/[0.65] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">Escala</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-8">
<div class="flex items-end gap-2">
<span class="text-5xl tracking-tight text-ink font-display font-medium" data-plan="business" data-price-monthly="R$29" data-price-annual="R$24">R$29</span>
<span class="pb-2 text-sm text-ink-soft" data-plan="business" data-period-monthly="/ usuário / mês" data-period-annual="/ usuário / mês, no anual">/ usuário / mês</span>
</div>
<p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Controles avançados e visibilidade para times que coordenam múltiplos projetos.</p>
</div>
<a class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/[0.12] bg-paper/[0.65] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink transition duration-300 ease-out hover:border-ink/[0.22] hover:bg-paper/[0.88]" href="#cta">Falar com vendas</a>
<div class="mt-8 h-px w-full bg-paper/[0.82]"></div>
<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-6 text-ink-soft">
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Tudo do plano Pro</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Permissões de administrador</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Relatórios de portfólio</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Suporte prioritário</li>
<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink/10 text-ink-2"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>Onboarding personalizado</li>
</ul>
</article>

</div>
<div class="text-center border-ink/[0.12] border rounded-[2rem] mt-10 pt-6 pr-6 pb-6 pl-6">
<p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Todos os planos incluem workspaces seguros, tarefas ilimitadas e uma interface tranquila que seu time aprende em minutos.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
